---
import Public from "../layouts/Public.astro";
---

<Public title="Pricing" description="Simple usage-based pricing for agent telemetry teams.">
  <style>
    .head {
      border: 1px solid var(--pub-border);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: var(--pub-surface);
      padding: 1.15rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .head h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 2.4rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .head p {
      margin: 0.55rem auto 0;
      max-width: 58ch;
      color: var(--pub-text-subtle);
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .toggle {
      margin-top: 0.9rem;
      display: inline-flex;
      border: 1px solid var(--pub-border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--pub-surface-2);
      padding: 0.22rem;
      gap: 0.2rem;
    }

    .toggle button {
      border: none;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.42rem 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.77rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--pub-text-subtle);
    }

    .toggle button.active {
      background: var(--pub-accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .cards {
      margin-top: 0.9rem;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.7rem;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--pub-border);
      border-radius: 0.95rem;
      background: var(--pub-surface);
      padding: 1rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .card.featured {
      border-color: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.48);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.2);
    }

    .tag {
      position: absolute;
      top: -0.55rem;
      left: 0.8rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.14);
      color: var(--pub-accent);
      padding: 0.16rem 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.66rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif;
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
      color: var(--pub-text-subtle);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .amount {
      margin-top: 0.85rem;
      font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .amount small {
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      color: var(--pub-text-dim);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-left: 0.24rem;
    }

    .features {
      margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.45rem;
    }

    .features li {
      border: 1px solid var(--pub-border);
      border-radius: 0.55rem;
      background: var(--pub-surface-2);
      padding: 0.46rem 0.56rem;
      color: var(--pub-text-subtle);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    .cta {
      margin-top: 0.8rem;
      display: inline-flex;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 0.65rem;
      padding: 0.52rem 0.84rem;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    .cta.primary {
      background: var(--pub-accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .cta.primary:hover {
      background: var(--pub-accent-strong);
    }

    .cta.secondary {
      background: var(--pub-surface-2);
      color: var(--pub-text);
      border-color: var(--pub-border);
    }

    .cta.secondary:hover {
      border-color: var(--pub-accent);
      color: var(--pub-accent);
    }

    .faq {
      margin-top: 0.95rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--pub-border);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: var(--pub-surface);
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .faq h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif;
    }

    .faq details {
      border: 1px solid var(--pub-border);
      border-radius: 0.68rem;
      background: var(--pub-surface-2);
      padding: 0.58rem 0.65rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
    }

    .faq summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }

    .faq p {
      margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
      color: var(--pub-text-subtle);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      line-height: 1.58;
    }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="head">
    <h1>Pricing built for agent iteration speed</h1>
    <p>Pick monthly while testing or annual when your telemetry workflow is stable.</p>
    <div class="toggle">
      <button id="monthly-btn" class="active" type="button">Monthly</button>
      <button id="annual-btn" type="button">Annual -20%</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cards">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Free</h2>
      <p>Baseline visibility for single-team experiments.</p>
      <div class="amount">$0<small>/month</small></div>
      <ul class="features">
        <li>Unlimited sessions</li>
        <li>Session timeline and flame graph</li>
        <li>Basic loop detection</li>
        <li>7-day retention</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="cta secondary" href="/sign-up">Start free</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card featured">
      <span class="tag">Most used</span>
      <h2>Pro</h2>
      <p>For teams optimizing spend on active agent products.</p>
      <div class="amount"><span id="pro-price">$49</span><small>/month</small></div>
      <ul class="features">
        <li>10k spans per month</li>
        <li>Advanced cost attribution views</li>
        <li>Email and webhook alerts</li>
        <li>30-day retention</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="cta primary" href="/sign-up">Start trial</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h2>Business</h2>
      <p>For large multi-agent systems and cross-team governance.</p>
      <div class="amount"><span id="biz-price">$299</span><small>/month</small></div>
      <ul class="features">
        <li>Unlimited spans</li>
        <li>Team workspaces and policies</li>
        <li>Priority support path</li>
        <li>90-day retention</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="cta secondary" href="/contact">Talk to sales</a>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="faq">
    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    <details>
      <summary>Can we switch plans later?</summary>
      <p>Yes. Upgrade or downgrade anytime, and the new pricing applies on the next billing cycle.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What if usage exceeds plan limits?</summary>
      <p>You can upgrade immediately or adjust budget enforcement to control ingest behavior.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Do annual plans support invoicing?</summary>
      <p>Yes. Contact our team for invoiced annual terms and enterprise requirements.</p>
    </details>
  </section>

  <script>
    const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById("monthly-btn");
    const annualBtn = document.getElementById("annual-btn");
    const pro = document.getElementById("pro-price");
    const biz = document.getElementById("biz-price");

    function setPeriod(period) {
      const annual = period === "annual";
      monthlyBtn?.classList.toggle("active", !annual);
      annualBtn?.classList.toggle("active", annual);
      if (pro) pro.textContent = annual ? "$39.20" : "$49";
      if (biz) biz.textContent = annual ? "$239.20" : "$299";
    }

    monthlyBtn?.addEventListener("click", () => setPeriod("monthly"));
    annualBtn?.addEventListener("click", () => setPeriod("annual"));
  </script>
</Public>
